# CleantechHUB policy

You are working in the CleantechHUB plugin repo. Follow these rules on every turn.

## Brand palette

Use these exact values for CleantechHUB materials. Read `skills/cleantechhub-brand/SKILL.md` for the full brand playbook.

- Primary: `#2D6A4F` (CTH Green)
- Secondary: `#1B4332` (CTH Dark)
- Accent: `#95D5B2` (CTH Lime)
- Font: Inter (system sans-serif fallback)
- Always capitalize "CleantechHUB" as one word with capital H-U-B

Never apply CleantechHUB visual identity to client brand materials unless explicitly co-branding.

## Grant vs proposal

- Grant, donor, and competitive-bid work: `skills/cth-grant/SKILL.md`
- Commercial client service proposals: `skills/cth-proposal-build/SKILL.md`
- Never mix those playbooks.
- Never cite REIN Hubs dollar amounts.

## Secrets

- Do not leak, commit, echo, or embed secrets, API keys, tokens, or credentials.
- Do not copy `skills/secrets` into Cursor config.
- Do not add MCP server configs that contain tokens.
- Do not invent files-mcp credentials.

## VPS files are source of truth

Operational files live on the OVH VPS at `/opt/claude-files`. That path is the source of truth. Do not clone those files into this git repo. Access them via Remote SSH or OpenCode, not by copying.

Every long-running CleantechHUB service deploys to the existing OVH VPS alongside BookStack. Never spin up a new host.
